WEBVTT

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:24.640
This time already?

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.290
Oh no, oh no, oh no!

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.750
If my first year as a working member of society is going to be like this...

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.550
...I'm worried about my future.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.420
What is she doing here by herself?

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:52.390
Excuse me, miss.

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:54.060
What are you doing here?

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.040
Miss?

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.210
You're...

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:03.510
...hitting on me!

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:04.790
Hitting on you?

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:06.450
You're hitting on me!

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:07.960
I saw it on TV!

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:11.960
Men try to pick up cute girls.

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.460
It's the beginning of a relationship.

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:17.010
Someone hit on me!

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:23.970
But on TV, the girl didn't fall in love with the guy who hit on her.

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.460
She fell in love with someone else.

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:29.210
I'm sorry! We're not meant to be together.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:32.480
What's wrong with this girl?

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.860
Hey, is your name Anzu-chan?

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:37.100
Anzu-chan, where are your mommy and daddy?

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:38.880
Daddy's working.

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:41.980
Mommy went to get something she forgot at home...

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:44.470
...so I'm waiting here.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:45.340
I see.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.090
Mommy's here!

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:51.490
There she is.

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:54.880
Look at the time!

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:56.620
Well, I've got to get going.

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:57.430
Okay.

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:58.430
See you later.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:01:59.440
Later.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:01.240
Watch out for cars.

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:06.920
Thanks for waiting.

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:09.360
Anzu, who were you waving to?

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.490
A man hit on me!

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:12.490
Hit on you?

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.500
Wow, Anzu. You're popular just like mommy.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:28.390
"Hanamaru Kindergarten Entrance Ceremony"

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:34.850
<i>Hanamaru Kindergarten</i>

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:37.810
"A Hanamaru Entrance Ceremony"

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:41.930
Starting today, you'll be attending Hanamaru Kindergarten, Anzu.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.700
Wow!

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:04.010
Wait, Anzu!

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.630
What is this?

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.560
What?

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:12.580
It's a water fountain.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.690
There's lots of places for water to come out.

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:18.980
What's this?

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.190
These might be towel hooks.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:23.640
Towel hooks?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.770
There's one hundred times as many as our house.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.660
That's an exaggeration.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.350
What's this?

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:31.990
It's a jungle gym.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:33.620
You climb and play on it.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:34.860
Climb it?

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.620
Think you can climb up here?

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.900
Kindergarten is fun!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:58.760
"Faculty Office"

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:58.660
Late on the day of the entrance ceremony.

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:01.740
Tsuchida-san, you must think you're a big shot.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.650
I'm sorry.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:07.270
The truth is, I was so nervous last night I couldn't sleep.

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:10.520
The entrance ceremony reception has already started.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.590
Yamamoto-sensei is taking care of everything herself.

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:15.330
Yamamoto-sensei?

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.660
Here you go. You're in the Sakura Class, Anzu-chan.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.000
Here's your badge and souvenir.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.120
Thank you.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.520
Let's go, Anzu.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:29.600
Excuse me. My name is Tsuchida, and I'm starting work today.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.090
Sorry for being late.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:44.400
Tsuchida-sensei, right?

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.150
I've heard about you.

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:51.010
Wait, sensei? Me?

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:56.580
You don't need to call me sensei. I'm not that great.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:05:00.040
I'm Yamamoto. It's nice to meet you.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.380
Oh, excuse me.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.460
See you later.

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:07.560
Bye-bye.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.590
Here are your badge and souvenir.

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:13.020
Good morning.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:13.680
Good...

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.720
Good morning.

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:16.400
Good morning.

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:17.850
She's so beautiful.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:22.180
I made the right choice becoming a kindergarten teacher.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:25.430
We'd like to begin the entrance ceremony.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:29.030
Please divide yourselves into the Sakura and Peach Classes and line up.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:33.480
It'll start any minute now.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:34.500
Yes.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.800
I'm a little nervous.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.240
It'll be fine.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:40.240
Let's work hard together.

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:45.220
That's very encouraging, Yamamoto-san.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.610
That shirt is a wonderful color.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.610
It looks great on you.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:51.770
Really?

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.760
She blew me off...

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:59.840
Starting today, you will be spending your days with your friends at this kindergarten.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:03.010
She's so pretty.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.210
Hey, I'm Anzu.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:06.430
Nice to meet you.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:07.980
Nice to meet you.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:10.690
Hey...

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.820
You should listen quietly when the teacher is speaking.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.640
Those are adult manners.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:16.620
Manners?

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.750
She's cute.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.240
Nice to meet you.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.290
Hello.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:32.050
Nice to meet you.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:33.910
Hello.

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:37.120
I hope we can be friends.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:42.650
Please speak up if you have any questions or concerns.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:44.760
Nice to meet all of you.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.570
Next is Sakura Class' Tsuchida-sensei.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:52.150
It's that guy from earlier.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:54.640
He's a kindergarten teacher.

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:57.600
Hello, everyone.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:01.000
My name is Tsuchida.

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:05.010
I graduated this spring and have started working here.

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:05.780
So he's Tsuchida-sensei.

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:07.750
It's a pleasure to meet all of you.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:13.070
I heard a male teacher started working this year, but I didn't know he'd be teaching my child.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.680
A male teacher? How unusual.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:18.680
He was a student until just recently. Is he really reliable?

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:24.690
I didn't think people would respond this badly to a male kindergarten teacher.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.660
I can't embarrass myself in front of Yamamoto-sensei.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.660
I've got to finish strong.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:37.340
I don't have much experience as a teacher...

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:39.290
...but I've always loved kids.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:43.200
I wish we had that lady teacher.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:43.900
Me too.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:48.230
But Tsuchida-sensei really does love kids.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:52.000
How do you know that?

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.590
That little girl...

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:52.850
Because...

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:53.740
...she's a student here.

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:55.000
How do you know?

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:59.120
Because Tsuchida-sensei hit on me!

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.510
What?

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:03.720
Tsuchida-sensei hit on you?

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.490
He hit on her?

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.250
A teacher hit on a kindergarten student?

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:13.160
It's because I'm so cute.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:14.220
She's a flirt.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.150
What does that mean?

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:17.060
What are you saying?

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:18.470
I didn't hit on you!

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:20.000
I never hit on you!

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:24.450
No!

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:27.140
There's no reason for me to hit on her!

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:30.620
That's not what I meant when I said I like children.

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:33.670
I like adult women, just like a normal person...

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:36.360
...preferably someone with big breasts.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.840
What am I saying?

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:42.200
He's unreliable, but he doesn't seem like a bad guy.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:44.470
Wait, that's not what I meant to say!

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.400
You're probably right.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.380
Tsuchida-sensei, you're so funny!

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.600
Thank you.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.890
But wait, I'm not trying to entertain you!

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.640
So that's the guy that hit on Anzu.

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:00.010
Huh?

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:02.740
No, that's impossible.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:08.140
I'm Anzu.

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:12.120
Sorry we couldn't have a proper conversation earlier.

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.010
I'm Hiiragi.

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:17.420
H-Hiiragi-chan? That's a difficult name.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.690
You can call me Hii-chan.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.660
What's your name?

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:26.910
Koume.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:28.750
What? I can't hear you.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:32.270
You probably shouldn't force it.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:34.270
This is terrible.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:36.020
That was rough.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:39.850
Explaining myself to the kids and their parents took all my energy.

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:44.450
Your explanation was incoherent, but I think they saw your sincerity.

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:46.230
Incoherent...

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:50.850
That's not what I meant...

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.660
I'm worried about my future.

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:55.010
You'll be fine.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.160
Everyone makes mistakes at first.

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:04.740
I thought adding a male teacher would be fun...

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:06.400
...but maybe it's a little too fun.

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:10.680
Not at all. He'll be worth training.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.200
What's wrong?

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.880
My ribbon...

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:34.640
Your ribbon?

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.920
My brother gave it to me.

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:42.550
It's my precious ribbon.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:46.160
That's too high up. We can't get it.

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:51.380
We can get it.

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:52.970
Really?

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.150
Leave it to me.

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:59.000
It's dangerous. You shouldn't do this.

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:00.670
I'm fine.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:06.550
What's going on?

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:14.300
What are you doing?

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.950
It's dangerous up there! Come down immediately!

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:17.860
Anzu!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.380
I'm fine! I'm good at climbing.

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:25.360
I'm so high up.

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:27.360
Are you okay?

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:30.870
But I need to get her ribbon.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.450
Tsuchida-sensei!

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:36.170
Take this.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.180
Yamamoto-sensei!

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.080
Got it!

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:00.600
Are you okay?

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:03.050
Yeah.

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:06.510
I see.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:09.260
Good.

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:13.360
Hey!

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.550
You shouldn't do dangerous stuff like that!

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:18.910
Think of all the trouble you'll cause everyone!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:21.040
Okay, I won't do it any more.

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:22.680
I'm glad you understand.

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:28.440
I got your ribbon.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:30.440
Thank you.

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:38.190
Thank goodness, Tsuchida-sensei.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.320
Huh? Yes.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:42.190
What's wrong?

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:44.280
Could you be Sakura-senpai?

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:49.740
Does that mean you're Tsuchi?

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:59.560
Um... I'm Koume.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.150
Koume-chan.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.390
Let's play together again tomorrow.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:04.570
Okay.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:08.860
We're always busy on special occasions...

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:10.910
...but today was especially hectic.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.120
It certainly was a lively day.

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:14.910
I'm sorry.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.270
Let me reintroduce everyone.

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:20.930
First we have second year Himawari Class teacher Kusano-sensei.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:21.900
Nice to meet you.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.620
Nice to meet you, too.

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:27.720
Next we have second year Tulip Class teacher Kawashiro-sensei.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.280
Nice to meet you.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.590
First year Peach Class teacher Yamamoto-sensei.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:34.450
Nice to meet you.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.600
Tsuchida-sensei, you were a big help today.

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.800
Oh, it was nothing.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:43.900
But the tardiness and flirting fuss cancels out your good deeds.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.120
What fuss?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.830
I didn't hit on anyone.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:50.560
Sorry, sorry.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.750
Oh, director.

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:55.080
What is it?

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.630
The parents seemed to find it unusual...

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:01.080
...but are male kindergarten teachers really that uncommon?

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:03.530
I've heard their numbers have been growing.

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:06.550
You're right, but according to a study conducted by the Ministry of Education...

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:09.620
...about one in fifty teachers are male.

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.830
One fiftieth?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.940
No wonder they thought it was unusual.

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:17.820
On top of that, you're our first male teacher.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.180
Is that so?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.090
Is something the matter?

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:31.750
Don't worry. Our kindergarten has a men's restroom.

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:33.620
I'm not worried about that!

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:37.280
The only man in a workplace full of women.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:40.310
Not bad.

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:41.530
By the way...

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:45.070
...Tsuchida-san, how do you know that girl's mother?

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:48.380
Oh, she was my senior during high school.

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:51.050
I had no idea she was living in this city.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.350
"A Hanamaru Mother"

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:58.720
Tsuchi!

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.240
Oh, Sakura-senpai.

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:04.290
Playing games up here by yourself again?

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.090
Mind your own business.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:10.270
Hey, do you think I could get some of your mother's cooking today?

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:11.390
Her cooking?

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:13.340
What about your husband?

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:15.840
He's busy preparing for his trip to the US.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:17.520
He said he'd be home late today.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.010
Senpai, are you really dropping out?

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:22.920
Yes.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:26.010
My husband has been invited to an American university...

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:27.830
...and I'm going with him.

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:31.370
After all, I'm his wife.

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:35.830
Typical.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.980
You run headfirst into things.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.400
Once you start, you can't be stopped.

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:43.110
Why can't you call it vitality?

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:45.810
But you'd graduate in six months.

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:47.840
True, but...

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.320
...we're married now.

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.450
I don't want us to be so far apart.

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:54.010
I see.

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:55.810
Are you sad?

00:15:57.070 --> 00:15:58.050
Not really.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.070
Besides...

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:06.370
...don't you think it would be better for our child to grow up living with a father?

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:10.040
Family of three.

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.090
I can't wait.

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.880
I can't imagine what your child will be like.

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.010
There you are!

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:20.270
Let's go, Sakura.

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:21.610
Sure.

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:22.630
Tsuchi.

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.970
I'm sure my kid will be just like me.

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:43.230
You and Tsuchida-sensei went to the same high school?

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:44.020
Yes.

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:47.250
He was my junior. I called him "Tsuchi."

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:49.920
He hasn't changed at all.

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:53.340
And a kindergarten teacher suits him perfectly.

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:55.530
Tsuchi, huh?

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:59.470
Tsuchi, Tsuchi, Tsuchi!

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:04.330
Sakura-senpai's child grew up into Anzu-chan.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.650
They really are alike.

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.650
They're both friendly...

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:12.180
...and they both do unbelievable things.

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:17.010
Senpai looked like she was doing well, too.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.680
Did she say she was working hard for a magazine?

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:21.890
In contrast...

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:23.740
Okay!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:37.690
Hii.

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:40.430
Did something good happen today?

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:45.170
Yes, I think I made some interesting friends.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.320
I see.

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:49.890
Your friend got your ribbon for you.

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:53.230
Yeah! And then Anzu-chan...

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:55.980
Tsuchi is wonderful.

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:57.260
He certainly is.

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:00.000
Tsuchi was so cool today.

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:01.010
Definitely.

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:03.230
I'm home!

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.490
Daddy's home!

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:09.750
Anzu, sorry I couldn't make it to your entrance ceremony.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.770
How was it? Was kindergarten fun?

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:16.290
Yeah! It was really, really fun!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.010
I'm glad.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:21.510
There was a bit of a surprise at the kindergarten.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:22.670
A surprise?

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:26.090
Tsuchi was at the kindergarten.

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:28.470
Not only that, but he's Anzu's teacher.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:30.980
Really? That Tsuchida-kun?

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:35.040
Daddy, you were mommy's teacher, right?

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:38.000
Yes. I was teaching art.

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:42.060
It was love as first sight, right?

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:44.250
Pretty much.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.130
Really?

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:47.650
Of course.

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:51.000
I guess I made a few mistakes today.

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:02.540
Yamamoto-sensei sure was cute.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.870
Alright. Tomorrow, I'll wake up early...

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.830
..and learn all kinds of things from Yamamoto-sensei before work.

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:12.350
Working together will bring us closer, and...

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.980
Oh, no! My ramen is overcooking.

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:23.990
I'm going to bed.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:28.840
Okay. I've got some work to finish before going to sleep.

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:30.290
Okay.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.010
Get your good-night kiss, Anzu.

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:35.110
I don't need one.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:37.680
Daddy is mommy's husband.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.310
I'll get a kiss from my darling.

00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:41.840
Your darling?

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:46.380
That's odd.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.190
Maybe I'm still nervous.

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:54.120
I'll just play until I get tired.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:02.450
I overslept again!

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.500
Oh no, oh no, oh no!

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:06.550
Tsuchi!

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:09.490
What are you doing here?

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:11.810
I have some business with you.

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:13.960
First, we have to thank you for yesterday.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:18.950
Thank you for rescuing me yesterday.

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.270
You're welcome.

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.120
One more thing.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.000
Anzu has something very important to tell you.

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:25.990
Important?

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:27.300
Go ahead, Anzu-chan.

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:28.640
I...

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:32.060
...I'll be your bride!

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:33.550
Bride?

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:34.790
Mine?

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.870
I love you, Tsuchi!

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:42.760
How precocious.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:46.820
Mommy, do you think I can be Tsuchi's bride?

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:48.290
Don't worry.

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:51.540
I'll do whatever it takes to get you married.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:54.130
What? Surely you're joking, Sakura-senpai.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:55.310
I'm pretty serious.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:21:00.140
But I'm an adult, and Anzu is a child...

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:03.560
Not a problem. It's only a difference of ten years or so.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:08.550
It might seem weird now, but in ten years you'll be a normal couple.

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:13.560
Oh, no. I wouldn't put it past her.

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:16.540
She married her teacher as a high school student.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.960
It's that guy that hit on the little girl.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:22.190
Maybe it wasn't a joke.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:25.900
Don't worry! They have our family's blessing!

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:28.920
Good morning.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:31.390
Anzu-chan's going for it.

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:34.000
Get a room, you two.

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:36.230
My, my...

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:37.930
...you two must be close.

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:39.960
We're getting married.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:41.490
How wonderful.

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:43.030
Congratulations.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:44.500
No, wait...

00:21:48.260 --> 00:21:50.340
What is Tsuchida-kun doing?

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:53.050
Today's shaping up to be another lively day.

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:55.310
Goodness gracious.

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:58.330
Things are getting a little too fun.

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:32.660
How is everyone?

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:35.530
We're about to spend some time together...

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:38.180
...but you don't want to listen to me talk the whole time.

00:23:38.180 --> 00:23:40.940
So next time Hii-chan will be taking over.

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:41.480
Roger that.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:44.180
The next episode is about a slide and Hii-chan's knowledge.

00:23:41.530 --> 00:23:43.140
"A Hanamaru Slide"

00:23:43.140 --> 00:23:44.740
"A Hanamaru Genius"

00:23:44.180 --> 00:23:44.740
See you then.

00:23:44.740 --> 00:23:49.440
"See you next time!"
